84 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Gender wage inequality is a persistent global issue that affects economic growth and workplace fairness. Despite various policies and initiatives aimed at promoting equality, disparities in salaries and employment opportunities between male and female employees continue to exist.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (With the advancement of data science, large datasets can be analyzed to uncover hidden patterns and trends in wage distribution. This project leverages data analysis techniques to study gender pay gaps across organizations. By examining salary differences, bonus distributions, and employee representation across pay levels, the study aims to provide insights into workplace inequality.The findings from this analysis can help organizations understand the extent of wage disparities and encourage data-driven decision-making for fair compensation practices.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
