/P 68 0 R
/T (Problem Statement:)
/E (Problem Statement:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (The objective of this project is to analyze gender pay gap data across multiple organizations to identify patterns of wage inequality between male and female employees. The project focuses on examining hourly pay differences, bonus distributions, and employee representation across salary quartiles.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
88 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (By applying exploratory data analysis techniques, the study aims to understand how gender-based disparities exist in compensation and workforce distribution. The results of this analysis can provide insights into the extent of inequality and highlight the need for improved policies to ensure fair pay practices.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
